Rule 5 (tensor input must not contain NaN values)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : v_1[i] ≠ NaN
